<figure id="S5.T4" class="ltx_table">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 4. </span>Comparison of model performance and per-round communication cost using Qwen2-7B as the base model. OOD represents Out-of-Domain. The best and second-best results are highlighted in bold and underline, respectively.</figcaption>
